script = ExtResource("2_dug5d")
full_text = "Day 1.

I opened my eyes.

The cold wind was gone.
The forests were gone.
The monsters were gone.

The runes.
The dungeons.
The ancient totems.

Gone.

For a moment, I thought I had failed.

Then I heard a voice.

\"He's waking up.\"

A bright light blinded me.

Machines beeped around my bed.
Doctors rushed into the room.

I tried to move.

Everything hurt.

\"Easy,\" someone said.

\"You've been unconscious for months.\"

Months?

None of it made sense.

I remembered fighting monsters.
I remembered collecting runes.
I remembered defeating the guardians hidden deep beneath forgotten lands.

But none of it was real.

There was no kingdom.

There were no dungeons.

There was no world to save.

There was only me.

And the accident.

A rainy evening.
A sudden flash of headlights.
Screeching tires.

Then darkness.

The doctors explained everything.

The entire world I had experienced was created by my own mind while I lay in a coma.

Every monster was a fear.

Every dungeon was a memory.

Every rune was a fragment of myself that I had lost.

And every battle brought me closer to waking up.

The final boss was never a creature.

It was the part of me that refused to let go.

The part that wanted to remain asleep forever.

I closed my eyes.

Not to escape.

But to remember.

The friends I met.

The places I explored.

The impossible world I called home.

Even if it never existed.

It saved me.

And now...

It was time to live in the real world again.

The End.
"
